{"title":"에스티오","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=cHdbr8/hAd4Bq0LYQ/4j5tlqhDmzMi1dlARDJTBK&filename=th3","synopsis":"\"날 부른 게... 당신입니까?\"\n까만 털의 짐승이 노랗게 빛나는 눈으로 그를 올려다보았다.\n\"이제 괜찮습니다. 더는 아프지 않을 겁니다. 괜찮으니까.\"\n\n농가의 막내 아들로 태어난 소년 에스티오.\n하지만 모든 사람들은 그를 미워했다.\n사람과 동물들의 마음을 읽는 아이.\n그리고...\n\n\"저주 받은 아이\"\n\n마침내 열아홉 살을 맞이한 성년식.\n행복을 찾기 위한 에스티오의 여정이 지금 시작된다.\n\n********************************\n공든탑 작가님의 웹소설 인기작 <에스티오> 본격 웹툰화!\n사람과 동물의 마음을 치유하는 에스티오의 여정에 함께 하세요!\n********************************","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":207,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":211,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":285,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":61}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":235,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":207,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":176,"change":{"type":"up","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":273,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":212,"change":{"type":"up","amount":61}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":201,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":183,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":130,"change":{"type":"up","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":180,"change":{"type":"down","amount":50}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":169,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":282,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":276,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":216,"change":{"type":"up","amount":60}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":248,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":222,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":198,"change":{"type":"up","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":20